                                px-3
                                py-2
                                mb-4
                            "
                        >
                            Modern PHP Application Framework
                        </span>


                        <h1 class="display-2 fw-bold mb-4">

                            Build powerful
                            <span class="text-primary">
                                PHP applications.
                            </span>

                        </h1>


                        <p class="lead text-secondary mb-4">

